{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"クイズの答えは..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！83回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\nYunaさんからいただきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/17/2664532/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんさんの卒業まで残りすくないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何を思うんだろう\n何を感じるんだろう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、1日を終えたあと\nらりんさんの卒業やっぱり嫌だ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思いました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、叫んだよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやだーーーー卒業しちゃうのいやだーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最高な3公演にするんだ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/17/2664532/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポニーテールしてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポニーテールって\n伝わらないけど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/17/2664532/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/17/2664532/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/17/2664532/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1001)  あずにゃんさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎ダイエットなんてしなくていいよ！\n今のままが魅力的ーーーーー！！！\nダイエットするする言ってしないきいにゃんが\n可愛すぎーーーーーー！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎きいにゃんを甘やかさないで～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたからは絶対！必ず！\nがんばる！おっしゃ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1175)  シミーズのマサさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎視線の先には何もない^o^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎お？どうだろう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その答え結構多かったけど、どうかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1200)  ホッケさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きーーーーたーーーの( ´ ▽ ` )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎なーーーーーにーーーーーー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"呼んだだけはだめだよー！！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1450)  あやっぴさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎みり愛ちゃん♪(*´ω｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎日奈子ちゃんだよ٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1717)  SKさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎1、2週間前から私もダイエットしています。私が今行っていることは、自分の好きな飲み物や食べ物（北野さんだったらアイス）を買わないことです。そうすることで、お金を節約することができる上に間食を減らすことができます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎いいですね。その方法！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしもなんでもすぐに買っちゃうくせがあるので、それは１つの手かも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたから挑戦してみます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1750)  チョイノリさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎あーちゃんと見せかけて、あしゅ‼︎\nかと思いきや結局答えはあーちゃんでしょ～\n答え楽しみにしてるね（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎どうだろう～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あやねかな？あしゅかな？誰かな？誰もいないかな？どうだろう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"～破壊なくして創造はなし～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1)  Tsuyoshiさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎かりんちゃんとバカンスしてたね笑\n本当はひなこが問題間違えてビーチフラッグしてほしかったな？？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎バカンスしてました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんとあの水上自転車をやったことも\n思い出♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビーチフラッグ得意だし、\nなによりバットを軸に回るのも\nめっちゃ早いから一位だったよ♪きっと！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(175)  わっちゃんさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃん焦らしやがってくそぉ～～|(￣3￣)|"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎うへへへへへへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もどかしいだろう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうちょっと焦らしておこう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(200)  よしさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃんなにしてもかわいい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎何しても可愛くないけど\n怒ったら絶対かわいくないよっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(317)  アヤ@ピカリンさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃんリクエストポーズの生写真が神贈物"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎リクエストポーズの生写真とは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どういうことだろ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(450)  岡山のよもぎ餅さん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃんが好きな可愛いペンギンの絵がいいなー！\nメンバーの似顔絵とかでも嬉しいなー笑\nまあ1番はきいちゃんのブログに名前あげてくれたら嬉しい笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎ペンギンは上手だよ～書くの～♪笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は正解者さんの名前をブログに載せようかな～と思ってたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしようーまだ迷ってるよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"